CREATED:20260928T180906Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260928T180906Z
UID:10014951-1795519800-1795539600@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Portraits of Things: Paintings by Gioia Fonda and Charlie Gill
DESCRIPTION:Portraits of Things: Paintings by Gioia Fonda and Charlie Gill at Pence Gallery in Davis \nExhibit: October 9 – November 29\, 2026 \nReception: Friday\, October 9\, 6-9 PM (Free) \nArtist Talk: Sunday\, November 8\, 2-3:30 PM (Free) \n  \nInterdisciplinary artist Gioia Fonda has long collected colorful toys\, both for their intrinsic charm and as creative inspiration. As a student at California College of the Arts\, she arranged small collectibles into still-life compositions\, captured them on film\, and processed the photos at a local drugstore. Captivated by these arrangements\, her advisor\, Charlie Gill\, painted spare compositions based on her photographs—works that now hang alongside hers. For this exhibition\, Fonda has created a series of new paintings featuring similar arrangements of toys and found objects. She is also offering an opportunity for members of the public to exhibit their own small works on paper\, riffing on some of her recent photos. Artists may add to this display throughout the duration of the show.  \n  \nSponsored by the Pence Community Curatorial Fund. \n  \nImage: Gioia Fonda\, “Holding It Together”
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/portraits-of-things-paintings-by-gioia-fonda-and-charlie-gill/2026-11-24/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Gioia-Fonda-Holding-It-Together-copy.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Visityolo Event": "https://visityolo.com/event/pence-gallery-holiday-market-3/2026-11-24/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:visityolo_event
X-SOURCE:Visityolo Event
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261124T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261124T170000
DTSTAMP:20261023T162643Z
CREATED:20261023T162643Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261023T162643Z
UID:10015338-1795519800-1795539600@visityolo.com
SUMMARY:Pence Gallery Holiday Market
DESCRIPTION:Pence Gallery Holiday Market in Davis \nNovember 13 – December 24\, 11:30 AM – 5 PM (Open daily*) \nReception: November 13\, 6-9 PM (Free) \nOur Holiday Market is a treasure trove of hand-crafted items created by regional artists and artisans\, perfect for holiday gift giving. Visitors can enjoy shopping for unique ceramics\, cozy knit scarves\, handmade jewelry\, amazing paintings\, and more! There are over 50 artists participating this year\, and our gallery will be overflowing with fun items that will make great gifts for loved ones. \n  \nHoliday Market Member Opening \nFriday\, November 13\, 10:30-11:30 AM (Free) \nPence Members are invited to enjoy a private opening of the Holiday Market from 10:30-11:30 AM. Enjoy delicious treats and coffee\, while getting first dibs on shopping for holiday treasures. Pence Members receive 10% off Holiday Market purchases. Not a Member? Sign up online at pencegallery.org or in person at the gallery. \n  \n*The Holiday Market is open daily from 11:30 AM – 5 PM (including Mondays)\, with the following exceptions: \nNov. 25: Closes at 3 PM \nNov. 26: Closed for Thanksgiving Day \nDec. 24: Closes at 3 PM (final day)
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/pence-gallery-holiday-market-3/2026-11-24/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/HM-2026-postcard-copy-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencesocialmedia@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
