SUMMARY:Ugly Sweater Mingle & Jingle
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to mingle\, jingle\, and stroll through Downtown Winters. Throw on your ugliest holiday sweater\, gather your friends\, and enjoy a festive evening filled with holiday cheer\, seasonal sips\, and plenty of fun! Make your way through downtown and stop by our participating locations for a holiday libation. The uglier the sweater\, the merrier the night! \nParticipating locations: The Back Alley at Preserve\, Berryessa Gap Vineyards\, DeVilbiss Room\, Putah Creek Cafe\, Buckhorn Steakhouse\, Hooby’s Brewing\, Patio 29\, Carboni’s Ristorante\, and Turkovich Family Wines.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/ugly-sweater-mingle-jingle/
LOCATION:Downtown Winters\, Main Street\, Winters\, CA\, 95694\, United States
