SUMMARY:World AIDS Day
DESCRIPTION:World AIDS Day honors the lives lost to AIDS-related illnesses\, supports people living with HIV\, and raises awareness about prevention\, treatment\, and access to care. It is an opportunity to challenge stigma\, share accurate information\, and promote compassion and dignity for everyone affected by HIV. \nLearn more at the World Health Organization.
